      "summary": "A provider's usage has a type, `ChatUsage`, in place of `any`; a structured result's summed usage keeps reasoning tokens once a call reports them, and `usageComplete` says whether every call reported usage, so a partial sum no longer reads as complete. Every release build writes `releases/digests.json` (each tarball's size, SHA-256 and integrity, with the input hash), committed with the release and checked against a fresh build, so a release stays verifiable from the repository after CI's artifact expires.",
